#: userland/apps/reliefapk/window.cpp:51
msgid ""
"Search by package name or description. Select one or more packages, choose an operation, then review the pending changes.\n"
"\n"
"Preview runs apk --simulate. Apply executes the changes in the displayed order. Each operation is checked again before execution.\n"
"\n"
"Refresh indexes after changing repositories or when available packages are missing. Installed packages remain available offline.\n"
"\n"
"Administrator operations use your system sudo or root authentication policy. Passwords are never saved.\n"
"\n"
"Ctrl+F: search    F5: refresh list    Ctrl+Enter: preview changes"
msgstr ""
"按软件包名称或说明搜索。选择一个或多个软件包，选择操作，然后查看待处理的更改。\n"
"\n"
"预览会运行 apk --simulate。应用会按显示的顺序执行更改。每项操作在执行前都会再次检查。\n"
"\n"
"更改仓库后，或找不到可用软件包时，请刷新索引。已安装的软件包仍可离线使用。\n"
"\n"
"需要管理员权限的操作会遵循系统的 sudo 或 root 身份验证策略。密码不会保存。\n"
"\n"
"Ctrl+F：搜索    F5：刷新列表    Ctrl+Enter：预览更改"

